  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN228.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">talaimakaṉ ciṟaippuṟattāṉākat talaimakaṭkuc colluvāḷāyt tōḻi colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What the confidante said being one who is speaking to HER while HE was behind the hedge.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN228.1">
        <l>piracap palkiḷai yārppak kalleṉa</l>
        <l>varaiyiḻi yaruvi yāran tīṇṭit</l>
        <l>tiṇṇē naṉaikku naḷimalaic cilampiṟ</l>
        <l>kaṇṇeṉa malarnta māyitaḻk kuvaḷaik</l>
        <l>kaṉmukai neṭuñcuṉai nammō ṭāṭip</l>
        <l>pakalē yiṉituṭaṉ kaḻippi yiravē</l>
        <l>celva rāyi ṉaṉṟumaṟ ṟilla</l>
        <l>vāṉkaṇ virinta pataṉmaru ṇilaviṟ</l>
        <l>cūra[ṉ] miḷaiiya cāra lārāṟ</l>
        <l>ṟōṅkaṉ micaiya vēṅkai yoḷvī</l>
        <l>pulippoṟi kaṭuppat tōṉṟaliṟ kayavā</l>
        <l>yirumpiṭi yiriyuñ cōlaip</l>
        <l>peruṅkal yā[ṇa]rttañ ciṟukuṭi yāṉē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="6a-c">Passing all day together pleasantly,</l>
        <l corresp="5">bathing with us in the long pools in stone caves</l>
        <l corresp="4">with large-petaled waterlilies that blossom like eyes</l>
        <l corresp="3">on the slope of the vast mountain which becomes truely wet</l>
        <l corresp="2">as the waterfall tumbling from the mountain grips the sandal trees,</l>
        <l corresp="1">noisily, while the many kin in the honeycomb hum,</l>
        <l rend="indent8" corresp="6d">by night,</l>
        <l corresp="7">if he went [back] it would be good</l>
        <l corresp="13">– to his small hamlet fertile among the big stones,</l>
        <l>with a grove where the soft-mouthed dark elephant cow</l>
        <l corresp="11f">retreats because of the tiger-spot-like appearance</l>
        <l corresp="10">of the bright flowers of the hillock’s kino trees, high</l>
        <l corresp="9">upon the difficult path on the slope closed in by rattan,</l>
        <l corresp="8">in seasonally diffuse moonlight that expanded in the sky.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="alternate" sameAs="3 4b">
        <l>in the long pools where bud, between the stones</l>
        <l>large-petaled waterlilies...</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
